WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.924
The year-ahead tarot spread uses a theme
card plus one card for each month.

00:00:05.924 --> 00:00:10.523
It works best as a prompt for planning and
reflection, not as a forecast.

00:00:11.823 --> 00:00:13.011
How the layout works.

00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:15.218
Place the first card at the top centre.

00:00:15.218 --> 00:00:18.104
This is your theme card, a lens for the
whole year.

00:00:19.404 --> 00:00:20.729
Preparing the question.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:25.163
A broad question is fine here, because the
spread already provides structure.

00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:28.925
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:28.925 --> 00:00:33.715
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
